# 2026-08-07: *.bak only matches files that END in .bak -- every
# "foo.cpp.bak-batch6-20260807-145635"-style timestamped patch backup (the
# pattern used throughout companion_system/ and by every Claude session doing
# a verified find/replace) has been slipping through and getting committed
# since 2026-08-04. Does not retroactively untrack ones already committed --
# see NOTES.md for the git rm --cached cleanup.
*.bak-*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
